    "detailed_description": "<strong>\u300a\u9508\u7fc5Without Wings\u300bDEMOcoming~~</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is a broken dream ...... is also a gentle persistence. </h2><br>Yi Yi.<br>I'm coming, I'm coming to find you.<br><br>----------------------------------------------<br><br>\u201cYi Yi&quot; is a short visual novel, developed by me independently.<br>Here, you will play the role of the protagonist &quot;GUI&quot;, to a city of eternal night.<br>This city has an eternal quiet moonlight night, but not a single bright sky light.<br>And the &quot;GUI&quot; is you, not anyone.<br>You feel that you have been to this place before, so you have been looking here ......<br>Until you meet Yi Yi.<br><br>&quot;Is that you?&quot;<br>&quot;It's me.&quot;<br><br>You have finally come.<br>Now, I am finally able to sincerely invite you into my dreams.<br>Happy dreaming.",
